WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.680
because we stand for what is good, what is virtuous,

00:03.680 --> 00:05.240
what is noble.

00:05.240 --> 00:08.820
And to those trying to incite violence against us,

00:08.820 --> 00:11.440
those trying to foment hatred against us,

00:11.440 --> 00:12.640
what do you have?

